#: ../../funding/startup-incubation-rent.rst:1
msgid "Shanghai pre-registration incubation rent subsidy"
msgstr "上海创业孵化期场地房租补贴"

#: ../../funding/startup-incubation-rent.rst:4
msgid "Reimbursement | Citywide / global"
msgstr "费用补贴｜全市／全球"

#: ../../funding/startup-incubation-rent.rst:6
msgid "Policy in force; call not confirmed open"
msgstr "政策有效，当前是否受理需确认"

#: ../../funding/startup-incubation-rent.rst:8
msgid ""
"`Evidence S117 "
"<https://www.shanghai.gov.cn/202308bmgfxwj/20230504/ee335ef455a04111ab3684cc1e991220.html>`_. "
"Shanghai startup social-insurance, incubation rent and first-startup "
"subsidies, valid through 2027."
msgstr "`资料来源 S117 <https://www.shanghai.gov.cn/202308bmgfxwj/20230504/ee335ef455a04111ab3684cc1e991220.html>`_. Shanghai startup social-insurance, incubation rent and first-startup subsidies, valid through 2027."

#: ../../funding/startup-incubation-rent.rst:10
msgid "Amount and mechanism"
msgstr "额度与支持方式"

#: ../../funding/startup-incubation-rent.rst:13
msgid ""
"Actual workstation cost before registration; up to RMB 10,000 and at most "
"6 months"
msgstr "补贴注册前实际承担的工位费，最高1万元，最长6个月"

#: ../../funding/startup-incubation-rent.rst:15
msgid "No equity"
msgstr "不占股"

#: ../../funding/startup-incubation-rent.rst:17
msgid "Eligibility and timing"
msgstr "申请条件与受理时间"

#: ../../funding/startup-incubation-rent.rst:20
msgid ""
"Teams entering a municipal demonstration incubation base and establishing "
"a qualifying startup organization during incubation. Only the period from "
"admission to registration is covered. Ask the base and district "
"employment service for the current evidence and filing procedure."
msgstr "入驻市级创业孵化示范基地，并在孵化期内成功创办规定创业组织的团队。仅覆盖入孵至注册之间的工位费，须向基地及本区就业服务部门确认凭证与办理流程。"

#: ../../funding/startup-incubation-rent.rst:22
msgid "Policy through 31 Dec 2027; confirm district procedure"
msgstr "政策至2027年12月31日，需确认本区办理流程"

#: ../../funding/startup-incubation-rent.rst:24
msgid "Contact and application"
msgstr "咨询与申请"

#: ../../funding/startup-incubation-rent.rst:27
msgid "`Official application / policy route <https://zwdt.sh.gov.cn/>`_"
msgstr "`官方申请渠道及政策文件 <https://zwdt.sh.gov.cn/>`_"

#: ../../funding/startup-incubation-rent.rst:29
msgid ""
"The linked authority or operator is the contact route. A direct current "
"program contact is not established in this profile."
msgstr "请通过所附链接联系主管部门或运营机构。本页尚未确认该项目的具体联系人。"

#: ../../funding/startup-incubation-rent.rst:31
msgid ""
"Editorial application checklist. The current official notice or agreement "
"controls the actual procedure."
msgstr "以下步骤为本书整理的申请参考，实际办理流程以最新官方通知或协议为准。"

#: ../../funding/startup-incubation-rent.rst:33
msgid ""
"Read the dated call and verify district, entity, activity and "
"spending-period rules."
msgstr "阅读有明确发布日期的通知，确认属地、申请主体、业务及费用发生期间等条件。"

#: ../../funding/startup-incubation-rent.rst:35
msgid ""
"Prepare the prescribed pack and complete host or district endorsement if "
"required."
msgstr "按清单准备材料，并按要求取得依托单位或区级部门推荐。"

#: ../../funding/startup-incubation-rent.rst:37
msgid ""
"Submit through the official platform before the stated deadline and keep "
"the receipt."
msgstr "在截止时间前通过官方平台提交，保存受理回执。"

#: ../../funding/startup-incubation-rent.rst:39
msgid ""
"Follow review, award, reporting, acceptance and payment obligations in "
"the notice."
msgstr "按通知要求完成评审、立项、报告、验收及资金拨付手续。"

#: ../../funding/startup-incubation-rent.rst:41
msgid ""
"The published maximum is a ceiling, not an entitlement. Check the "
"applicable notice, eligible cost period, other public support and written "
"payment conditions."
msgstr "公布额度是最高限额，不代表申请即可获得。申报前请核对适用通知、认可的费用发生期间、已获其他财政支持及书面拨付条件。"
